+### `app.isBrowserPasskeySupported()` _macOS_
+
+Returns `boolean` - Whether Chromium's macOS browser passkey API is available
+to this application. Requires macOS 13.5 or later and Apple's browser public-key
+credential entitlement. Call after the `ready` event.
+
+This method does not enable the authenticator. When it returns `true`, enable
+platform passkeys with `app.configureWebAuthn({ platformPasskeys: true })`.
+Browser passkeys use the operating system's credential provider for arbitrary
+relying parties; the application's Associated Domains configuration is not used.
+
 ### `app.configureWebAuthn(options)` _macOS_
 
